cx=&#x27;12&#x27; cy=&#x27;12&#x27; r=&#x27;10&#x27; stroke=&#x27;%23d1d5db&#x27; stroke-width=&#x27;4&#x27;/%3E%3Cpath class=&#x27;opacity-75&#x27; fill=&#x27;%23d1d5db&#x27; d=&#x27;M4 12a8 8 0 018-8V0C5.373 0 0 5.373 0 12h4zm2 5.291A7.962 7.962 0 014 12H0c0 3.042 1.135 5.824 3 7.938l3-2.647z&#x27;/%3E%3C/svg%3E&quot;);background-position:center;background-repeat:no-repeat;background-size:24px;transition:background 0.2s"/></picture></div></div></div></div></section><section class="bg-white" id="custom-sample-options"><div class="container px-3 md:px-6 mx-auto py-16 md:py-24 lg:py-32"><div class=""><h2 class="text-slate-700 h2 mb-4">Custom sample options</h2></div><div class="text-slate-500 text-lg leading-relaxed font-[350] mb-10"><div class="[&amp;_h3]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:mb-5"><div class="dynamic-content mb-4"><p>Get custom samples to test size, structure, artwork and finishes. Custom samples are reimbursable when ordering at least 500 units.</p>
</div></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-6 md:gap-8 md:col-span-12 text-slate-700"><div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-4"><div><h3 class="h4 mb-2">Structural Sample</h3><div class="dynamic-content text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-500"><p><strong>Blank, unprinted sample</strong></p>
<p>Custom size and material. Ideal for verifying size and structure</p>
<a href="/samples/structural-sample/" class="btn-primary-outline px-8 py-2 rounded-md my-6" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Learn more</a></div></div></div><div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-4"><div><h3 class="h4 mb-2">Simplified Sample</h3><div class="dynamic-content text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-500"><p><strong>Low-fidelity printed sample</strong></p>
<p>Custom size, material, and CMYK print with digital printers. No finishes or add-ons.</p>
<a href="/samples/simplified-sample/" class="btn-primary-outline px-8 py-2 rounded-md my-6" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Learn more</a>
</div></div></div><div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-4"><div><h3 class="h4 mb-2">Pre-production Sample</h3><div class="dynamic-content text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-500"><p><strong>1:1 production sample</strong></p>
<p>A 1:1 sample ideal for seeing the exact outcome of your packaging with no limitations on print, finishes, and add-ons.</p>
<a href="/samples/pre-production-sample/" class="btn-primary-outline px-8 py-2 rounded-md my-6" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Learn more</a></div></div></div><div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-4"><div><a class="" href="https://packmojo.com/samples/digital-print-proof/"></a><h3 class="h4 mb-2">Print Proof</h3><div class="dynamic-content text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-500"><p><strong>Flat color proof in CMYK</strong></p>
<p>Printed with digital printers and ideal for seeing colors close to the final outcome in production.</p>
<a href="/samples/digital-print-proof/" class="btn-primary-outline px-8 py-2 rounded-md my-6" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Learn more</a>
</div></div></div><div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-4"><div><h3 class="h4 mb-2">Press Proof</h3><div class="dynamic-content text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-500"><p><strong>Flat color proof with finishes and add-ons</strong></p>
<p>Printed with the actual print facilities used in production and ideal for seeing the exact colors to be printed.</p>
<a href="/samples/press-proof/" class="btn-primary-outline px-8 py-2 rounded-md my-6" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Learn more</a></div></div></div><div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-4"><div><h3 class="h4 mb-2">Pantone Color Chip</h3><div class="dynamic-content text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-500"><p><strong>Flat Pantone color reference</strong></p>
<p>Ideal for having a physical Pantone color reference.</p>
<a href="/samples/pantone-color-chip/" class="btn-primary-outline px-8 py-2 rounded-md my-6" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Learn more</a>
</div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="bg-white" id="sample-recommendations"><div class="container px-3 md:px-6 mx-auto py-16 md:py-24 lg:py-32"><div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto"><h2 class="text-slate-700 h2 mb-4">Sample Recommendations</h2></div><div class="text-center text-slate-500 text-lg leading-relaxed font-[350] mb-10 max-w-xl mx-auto"><div class="[&amp;_h3]:mb-3 [&amp;_p]:mb-5"><div class="dynamic-content mb-4"><p>Not sure which sample to go with? Here's what we recommend.</p>
