with custom size and material. Ideal for verifying size and structure with your physical products.","url":"https://packmojo.com/samples/structural-sample/"}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"item":{"@type":"WebPage","name":"Simplified Sample","description":"Low-fidelity printed sample featuring custom size, material, and CMYK print with digital printers. No finishes or add-ons.","url":"https://packmojo.com/samples/simplified-sample/"}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":4,"item":{"@type":"WebPage","name":"Pre-production Sample","description":"A 1:1 production sample ideal for seeing the exact outcome of your packaging with no limitations on print, finishes, and add-ons.","url":"https://packmojo.com/samples/pre-production-sample/"}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":5,"item":{"@type":"WebPage","name":"Print Proof","description":"Flat color proof in CMYK printed with digital printers on proofing paper. Ideal for checking colors and artwork alignment.","url":"https://packmojo.com/samples/digital-print-proof/"}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":6,"item":{"@type":"WebPage","name":"Press Proof","description":"Flat color proof with finishes and add-ons printed with the actual production print facilities. Ideal for seeing exact colors.","url":"https://packmojo.com/samples/press-proof/"}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":7,"item":{"@type":"WebPage","name":"Pantone Color Chip","description":"Flat Pantone color reference printed on the exact material used in production to preview and confirm colors before a bulk production run.","url":"https://packmojo.com/samples/pantone-color-chip/"}}]}},{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://packmojo.com/#organization","name":"PackMojo","url":"https://packmojo.com/","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","@id":"https://packmojo.com/#logo","url":"https://packmojo.com/cms_assets/Pack_Mojo_logo_default_819f5d5d14.png","width":"3608","height":"800","caption":"PackMojo Logo"}}]},"page":{"id":782,"navigationTitle":"Samples","slug":"samples","jsonSchema":{"@context"