e options","subTitle":"Get custom samples to test size, structure, artwork and finishes. Custom samples are reimbursable when ordering at least 500 units.","textColor":"default","backgroundColor":"white","backgroundImageOverlayAmount":0.7,"parallaxAmount":0.6,"secondaryContent":false,"contentAlignment":"start","columnContentAlignment":"start","size":"standard","style":"default","columnBackgroundColor":"white","navigationTitle":null,"actions":[],"backgroundImage":null,"columns":[{"id":2730,"title":"Structural Sample","content":"\u003cstrong\u003eBlank, unprinted sample\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCustom size and material. Ideal for verifying size and structure\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"/samples/structural-sample/\" class=\"btn-primary-outline px-8 py-2 rounded-md my-6\"\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e","link":null,"columnCssOverride":"md:col-span-4","imageCssOverride":null,"icon":null,"image":null},{"id":2731,"title":"Simplified Sample","content":"\u003cstrong\u003eLow-fidelity printed sample\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCustom size, material, and CMYK print with digital printers. No finishes or add-ons.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"/samples/simplified-sample/\" class=\"btn-primary-outline px-8 py-2 rounded-md my-6\"\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e\n","link":null,"columnCssOverride":"md:col-span-4","imageCssOverride":null,"icon":null,"image":null},{"id":2732,"title":"Pre-production Sample","content":"\n\u003cstrong\u003e1:1 production sample\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA 1:1 sample ideal for seeing the exact outcome of your packaging with no limitations on print, finishes, and add-ons.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"/samples/pre-production-sample/\" class=\"btn-primary-outline px-8 py-2 rounded-md my-6\"\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e","link":null,"columnCssOverride":"md:col-span-4","imageCssOverride":null,"icon":null,"image":null},{"id":2733,"title":"Print Proof","content":"\u003cstrong\u003eFlat color proof in CMYK\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePrin